# MQ00 stage 65 and MQ01 "Auf zum Sanktum". In the abbey the player shows the forged letter to the high priest
# Aratornias (topic "[Aratornias den Brief zeigen]", INFO 00005BE0 on MQ00 stage 60: sets MQ00 65, MQ01 5, starts NQ05
# and takes the letter); then goes to the Magiersanktum and meets the archmage Vanmiria (greeting INFO 001A3DCF, MQ01 5:
# sets MQ02 5 and MQ01 10). Stages are TES4 numbers.

# Aratornias is in the abbey (cell AbteiTirinAbtei). The player walks in from the abbey yard; moveto to his placed ref
# (00005536) stands in for that walk because the abbey door is not traced here.
case handin_aratornias
console player.moveto 00005536
talk HohepriesterAratornias
ask "[Aratornias den Brief zeigen]"
hear 300 HohepriesterAratornias zur Armee
bye
expect GetStageDone MQ00 65
expect GetStageDone MQ01 5
expect GetStageDone NQ05 5
expect player.GetItemCount MQ00Brief == 0
end

# The way to the Sanktum is a long road east (Giliad, then the eastern mountains): moveto Vanmiria's ref stands in for
# the whole trip; nothing follows the player. Her say-once greeting tells the player of the pilgrimage.
case sanktum_vanmiria
console player.moveto AuVanmiriaRef
talk AUVanmiria
hear 300 AuVanmiriaRef Neuank
bye
expect GetStageDone MQ01 10
expect GetStageDone MQ02 5
end
